WEBVTT

00:02.640 --> 00:03.920
General Chen

00:04.000 --> 00:06.667
You come with a Ministry of War order

00:06.840 --> 00:09.160
To take my, Prince of Jin's, military command

00:09.240 --> 00:11.240
I'm afraid that's not enough authority

00:11.720 --> 00:12.640
How about

00:12.720 --> 00:14.120
General Chen

00:14.200 --> 00:15.960
Go get an imperial edict

00:16.360 --> 00:19.000
Your Highness is deliberately making this difficult

00:20.120 --> 00:21.520
See the guest out

00:38.320 --> 00:39.600
I said the second prince

00:39.720 --> 00:41.120
Definitely has treacherous intentions

00:41.640 --> 00:43.040
Look

00:44.360 --> 00:45.760
Leaving him outside

00:46.080 --> 00:48.080
Will cause trouble sooner or later

00:48.520 --> 00:50.853
When Prince of Jin was imprisoned before

00:51.120 --> 00:52.400
I advised Your Highness

00:52.480 --> 00:54.080
To go all the way

00:54.480 --> 00:55.720
But Your Highness then

00:55.840 --> 00:57.240
Hesitated

00:57.720 --> 00:59.440
Chancellor Chen, don't tease me

00:59.720 --> 01:00.400
Now

01:00.480 --> 01:01.640
We must prevent the second prince

01:01.720 --> 01:04.387
From raising troops and marching on the capital

01:08.600 --> 01:10.600
Order Qingzhou Army vanguard

01:10.880 --> 01:11.760
Forced march

01:11.840 --> 01:13.040
Abandon supplies

01:13.120 --> 01:15.000
I don't care how many die from exhaustion

01:15.080 --> 01:16.280
At the fastest speed

01:16.360 --> 01:18.027
Rush to all the passes

01:18.240 --> 01:18.720
Must

01:18.880 --> 01:20.520
Get there before Prince of Jin

01:20.600 --> 01:21.720
Yes

01:23.000 --> 01:38.000
Ten days later, Lu Xun led the Qingzhou Army to blockade all critical passes and strategic routes along the Tianhe River. By the time you thought of raising troops, it was already too late.

01:38.080 --> 01:45.000
Prince Ning's hidden ambushes erupted on all sides. Though your personal guard fought furiously to the death, escape proved impossible.

